                          <span>Segurança Soberana, Firewall WAF & Cloudflare Nameservers</span>
                        </span>
                        {openSections.security ? <ChevronUp className="w-4 h-4" /> : <ChevronDown className="w-4 h-4" />}
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    {openSections.security && (
                      <>
                        <tr>
                          <td className="p-4 px-6 text-slate-300">Proteção contra ataques DDoS de camada 7</td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-slate-400">Padrão</td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-white bg-indigo-950/20">Padrão</td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400 font-bold">Aprimorado</td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400 font-bold">Aprimorado Avançado</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td className="p-4 px-6 text-slate-300">Firewall de Aplicação Web (WAF) vpsNsA</td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400"><Check className="w-4 h-4 mx-auto" /></td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400 bg-indigo-950/20"><Check className="w-4 h-4 mx-auto" /></td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400"><Check className="w-4 h-4 mx-auto" /></td>
                          <td className="p-4 text-center text-emerald-400"><Check className="w-4 h-4 mx-auto" /></td>
                        </tr>
                      </>
                    )}

                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          )}

          {/* ABA DE DEPLOY GITHUB */}
          {activeTab === 'deploy' && (
            <div className="bg-[#0D121F] border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-6 shadow-xl">
              <h3 className="text-base font-bold text-white">Deploy Automático via GitHub (vpsNsA Engine)</h3>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <input type="text" placeholder="https://github.com/usuario/projeto" value={repoUrl} onChange={(e) => setRepoUrl(e.target.value)} className="bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200 outline-none" />
                <input type="text" placeholder="meusite.com.br" value={targetDomain} onChange={(e) => setTargetDomain(e.target.value)} className="bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200 outline-none" />
              </div>
              <button onClick={handleExecuteDeploy} disabled={isDeploying} className="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 text-white font-bold text-xs py-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                {isDeploying ? <RefreshCw className="w-4 h-4 animate-spin" /> : <GitBranch className="w-4 h-4" />}
                <span>{isDeploying ? 'Executando Deploy no Linux...' : 'Executar Deploy Soberano'}</span>
              </button>
              {deployLogs.length > 0 && (
                <div className="bg-[#080B11] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 font-mono text-[11px] space-y-1 text-slate-300">
                  {deployLogs.map((log, idx) => <div key={idx}>&gt; {log}</div>)}
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          )}

          {/* ABA DE PARCEIROS MERCADO PAGO */}
          {activeTab === 'partners' && (
            <div className="bg-[#0D121F] border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl">
              <h3 className="text-base font-bold text-white">Parceiros de Código Aberto (Open Source Partner)</h3>
              <form onSubmit={handleGeneratePartnerButton} className="space-y-4">
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  <input type="url" required placeholder="Link do GitHub" value={devRepo} onChange={(e) => setDevRepo(e.target.value)} className="bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200" />
                  <input type="text" required placeholder="Chave / E-mail Mercado Pago" value={mpAccount} onChange={(e) => setMpAccount(e.target.value)} className="bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200" />
                </div>
                <button type="submit" className="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-cyan-600 text-white font-bold text-xs py-2.5 rounded-xl">
                  Gerar Botão "Implantar na vpsNsA" com Retorno MP
                </button>
              </form>
              {markdownSnippet && (
                <pre className="bg-[#151C2C] p-3 rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-200 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-800">
                  {markdownSnippet}
                </pre>
              )}
            </div>
          )}

          {/* ABA DE CHAT COM IA GOOGLE AI STUDIO */}
          {activeTab === 'aichat' && (
            <div className="bg-[#0D121F] border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl flex flex-col h-[500px]">
              <div className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-3 p-3 bg-[#080B11]/60 rounded-xl">
                {chatMessages.map((msg) => (
                  <div key={msg.id} className={`flex ${msg.sender === 'user' ? 'justify-end' : 'justify-start'}`}>
                    <div className={`max-w-[80%] p-3 rounded-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed ${msg.sender === 'user' ? 'bg-indigo-600 text-white' : 'bg-[#151C2C] text-slate-200'}`}>
                      {msg.text}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                ))}
                <div ref={chatEndRef} />
              </div>
              <form onSubmit={handleSendAiMessage} className="flex gap-2">
                <input type="text" value={chatInput} onChange={(e) => setChatInput(e.target.value)} placeholder="Digite sua dúvida ou comando..." className="flex-1 bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-200 outline-none" />
                <button type="submit" disabled={isAiLoading} className="bg-cyan-600 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span>Enviar</span>
                  <Send className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
                </button>
              </form>
            </div>
          )}

          {/* PROVA SOCIAL E PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQ) DE AGÊNCIA */}
          <div className="bg-[#0D121F] border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
            <div className="text-center space-y-2">
              <h2 className="text-2xl font-black text-white">Mais de 5 milhões de pessoas criaram seus sites na vpsNsA.</h2>
              <p className="text-xs text-slate-400">Perguntas frequentes (FAQ) sobre planos de hospedagem soberana</p>
            </div>

            <div className="space-y-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-2">
              {[
                { q: "Qual a diferença entre os planos Cloud e Agency da vpsNsA?", a: "Os planos Cloud são focados em alta capacidade isolada para um único projeto pesado. Os planos Agency oferecem um painel White-label completo para você gerenciar de 100 a 300 sites de terceiros e revender com sua própria marca." },
                { q: "Já tenho um site na Hostinger ou outro provedor. Posso transferi-lo para a vpsNsA?", a: "Sim! Nossa ferramenta de migração automática transfere todos os seus arquivos, banco de dados MySQL e SSL para a vpsNsA gratuitamente sem interrupção de serviço." },
                { q: "Como recebo minhas comissões do programa de Código Aberto?", a: "Ao cadastrar sua conta do Mercado Pago no painel, o valor gerado através do botão de implantação cai diretamente na sua chave cadastrada." }
              ].map((faq, idx) => (
                <div key={idx} className="bg-[#151C2C] border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
                  <button onClick={() => setOpenFaq(openFaq === idx ? null : idx)} className="w-full px-6 py-4 text-left font-bold text-xs text-white flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span>{faq.q}</span>
                    {openFaq === idx ? <ChevronUp className="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" /> : <ChevronDown className="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" />}
                  </button>
                  {openFaq === idx && (
                    <div className="px-6 pb-4 text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 pt-3">
                      {faq.a}
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

        </main>
      </div>

      {/* RODAPÉ EXECUTIVO */}
      <footer className="w-full bg-[#0D121F] border-t border-indigo-500/20 px-6 py-2 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
        <span>© 2026 vpsNsA Sovereign Cloud — www.nsaoficial.com.br</span>
        <span className="font-semibold text-slate-400">CEO Márcio Francisco de Almeida</span>
      </footer>

    </div>
  );
}

export default App;
